+### Custom genome size
+
+Custom [genome sizes](#genome-sizes-genome-size-genome-size-files) can be provided in the file, either for `--input-target sequence` or `file` with or without specialization information. Note that `--genome-size` must be set to `auto` or `assembly-custom` for those values to be used. The examples below show tabs as `<tab>` for clarity.
+
+With specialiation:
+
+```tsv
+sequences.fasta <tab> sequences <tab> 562 <tab> ID44444 <tab> Escherichia coli TW10119  <tab> 250000
+others.fasta    <tab> others    <tab> 623 <tab> ID55555 <tab> Shigella flexneri 1a      <tab> 36585
+```
+
+Without specialiation:
+
+```tsv
+sequences.fasta <tab> sequences <tab> 562 <tab> <tab> <tab> 250000
+others.fasta    <tab> others    <tab> 623 <tab> <tab> <tab> 36585
+```
+
+
